{"name": "堂食收入链路 · 脱敏复刻", "nodes": [{"shape": "pill", "x": 528, "y": 280, "w": 312, "h": 108, "color": "orange", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-01", "text": "堂食净收入\nDAILY REVENUE", "comment": "应用层汇总各收入渠道。父项与子项只能选一个层级汇总，避免重复计入。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 264, "y": 184, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-02", "text": "团购渠道 B", "comment": "来源为核销记录。业务日期与数据到齐时间需要分开处理，未到采集期不等于漏数。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 184, "y": 312, "w": 216, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-03", "text": "团购渠道 C", "comment": "来源为订单商品明细，商品数量与订单数量分别定义，不能互相代替。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 248, "y": 424, "w": 176, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-04", "text": "团购渠道 A", "comment": "收入按交易类型计算并保留正负号，订单计数与明细行数分开处理。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 424, "y": 560, "w": 192, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-05", "text": "预留渠道", "comment": "图中保留扩展位置，目前尚未接入。虚线表示规划，不能当成已运行的数据链路。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 952, "y": 424, "w": 192, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-06", "text": "人工补录", "comment": "人工数据按日、周或月填报。金额与单数分别分摊，展开前后的合计必须一致。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 1008, "y": 312, "w": 192, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-07", "text": "权益类收入", "comment": "作为独立业务口径展示；与收银或储值口径核对后再汇总，避免重复计入。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 605, "y": 184, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-08", "text": "收银渠道 A · 合计", "comment": "由三个子渠道组成。展示拆分的同时，汇总只使用父项或子项其中一组。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 792, "y": 560, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-09", "text": "收银渠道 B", "comment": "不同收银系统的归属范围需要明确，不能按同一门店直接叠加。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 960, "y": 184, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-10", "text": "历史渠道", "comment": "历史留存与当前采集分开说明。保留历史值，不代表当前仍有自动采集任务。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 437, "y": 40, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "indigo", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-11", "text": "小程序 B", "comment": "属于收银渠道 A 的子渠道，继承统一收入明细的金额与计数定义。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 605, "y": 40, "w": 160, "h": 44, "color": "indigo", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-12", "text": "小程序 A", "comment": "属于收银渠道 A 的子渠道。渠道按订单来源区分，不按支付方式重复拆分。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 773, "y": 40, "w": 168, "h": 44, "color": "indigo", "fontSize": 18, "id": "node-13", "text": "门店收银", "comment": "属于收银渠道 A 的子渠道。父级总额已包含这部分收入。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "cylinder", "x": 498, "y": -448, "w": 366, "h": 140, "color": "yellow", "fontSize": 22, "bold": true, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-14", "text": "DWS · 门店渠道收入", "comment": "按门店、业务日期与渠道汇总统一明细。只汇总已定义指标，不再重新判断退款和有效订单。"}, {"shape": "junction", "x": 672, "y": -312, "w": 20, "h": 20, "color": "gray", "fontSize": 14, "fill": "solid", "id": "node-15", "text": "", "comment": ""}, {"shape": "junction", "x": 1336, "y": 48, "w": 20, "h": 20, "color": "gray", "fontSize": 14, "fill": "solid", "id": "node-16", "text": "", "comment": ""}, {"shape": "junction", "x": 48, "y": 48, "w": 20, "h": 20, "color": "gray", "fontSize": 14, "fill": "solid", "id": "node-17", "text": "", "comment": ""}, {"shape": "group", "x": 168, "y": 16, "w": 1052, "h": 604, "color": "blue", "fontSize": 22, "bold": true, "id": "node-18", "text": "ADS · 门店经营日报", "comment": "按渠道展开并发布收入指标。同一张日报表的不同主题各自维护所属字段。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "cylinder", "x": 496, "y": -744, "w": 366, "h": 140, "color": "cyan", "fontSize": 22, "bold": true, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-19", "text": "DWD · 统一收入明细", "comment": "保留统一门店、日期、渠道、金额和订单计数。不同平台的原始口径在这一层转换。"}, {"shape": "rect", "x": 297, "y": -960, "w": 760, "h": 96, "color": "pink", "fontSize": 22, "bold": true, "id": "node-20", "text": "入仓校验 · 门店映射 / 日期 / 逐行对数", "comment": "先校验门店映射、业务日期与关键字段。按指定分区在事务内写入并逐行核对，不一致时回滚；未确认映射留待处理。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": -400, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-21", "text": "ODS · 人工填报", "comment": "保留原始填报粒度。检查日期范围、唯一标识和门店归属，拒绝日期重叠与矛盾映射。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": -89, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-22", "text": "ODS · 团购 A 明细", "comment": "保留源报表的交易类型、业务时间、金额与记录标识。收益明细和汇总报表不能相加。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 223, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-23", "text": "ODS · 团购 B 核销", "comment": "按来源语义识别核销时间。字段英文名称不一定等于实际业务含义。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 856, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-24", "text": "ODS · 团购 C 订单", "comment": "保留平台订单与商品信息。下游按已确认的订单状态与门店映射转换。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 1179, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-25", "text": "ODS · 收银 A 流水", "comment": "收款、退款、零元订单标记分别处理，原始记录条数不直接当成有效订单数。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 1489, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "purple", "fontSize": 22, "id": "node-26", "text": "ODS · 收银 B 流水", "comment": "按来源字段保留流水金额和单数。与另一套收银系统明确分工，避免重复收入。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "pill", "x": 538, "y": -1296, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "gray", "fontSize": 22, "dashed": true, "id": "node-27", "text": "ODS · 预留位置\n尚未接入", "comment": "预留的模型位置，不代表已经建表或部署任务。", "textColor": "ink"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": -400, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-28", "text": "人工填报\n直接进入 ODS", "comment": "人工输入与平台采集分开管理，入仓后仍经过校验及口径转换。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": -89, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-29", "text": "团购 A · 报表采集\nPython / DataX", "comment": "自动下载平台报表，保留原文件，再按来源粒度入仓。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": 223, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-30", "text": "团购 B · 核销采集\nPython / DataX", "comment": "按平台的数据成熟周期采集对应业务日期，记录当次回执。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": 856, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-31", "text": "团购 C · 订单采集\nPython / DataX", "comment": "订单采集和业务加工分别调度，依赖对应日期的成功回执。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": 1179, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-32", "text": "收银 A · 业务库\nDataX", "comment": "从业务库读取必要数据，采集与后续业务计算分层。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": 1489, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "teal", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "id": "node-33", "text": "收银 B · 业务库\nDataX", "comment": "使用独立采集分支接入，门店与业务口径在后续层统一。"}, {"shape": "rounded", "x": 538, "y": -1608, "w": 272, "h": 60, "color": "gray", "fontSize": 22, "textColor": "ink", "dashed": true, "id": "node-34", "text": "渠道扩展位\n尚未接入", "comment": "为后续接入保留位置，公开图中明确标为未接入。"}], "edges": [{"fromHandle": "right", "toHandle": "left", "color": "blue", "line": "smooth", "arrow": "end", "flow": true, "width": 1, "flowStyle": "comet", "flowColor": "blue", "id": "edge-01", "to": "node-01", "label": "", "from": "node-03"}, {"fromHandle": "right", "toHandle": "left", "color": "blue", "line": "smooth", "arrow": "end", "flow": true, "width": 1, "flowStyle": "comet", "flowColor": "blue", "id": "edge-02", "to": "node-01", "label": "", "from": "node-02"}, {"fromHandle": "right", "toHandle": "left", "color": "blue", "line": "smooth", "arrow": "end", "flow": true, "width": 1, "flowStyle": "comet", "flowColor": "blue", "id": "edge-03", "to": "node-01", "label": "", "from": "node-04"}, {"fromHandle": "right", "toHandle": "bottom", "color": "gray", "line": "smooth", "arrow": "end", "flow": false, "width": 1, "flowStyle": "comet", "flowColor": "blue", "id": "edge-04", "to": "node-01", "label": "", "from": "node-05", "dashed": true}, {"fromHandle": "left", "toHandle": "bottom", "color": "blue", "line": "smooth", "arrow": "end", "flow": true, "width": 1, "flowStyle": "comet", "flowColor": "blue", "id": "edge-05", "to": "node-01", "